A pet dog will kill a pack of jackals, no problems, but it won't (or at
least it shouldn't) eat the corpses unless starving, in which case it
will eat only one. This means you get all the d corpses without the
danger of killing the things yourself, or the improbability of beating
your pet to the steaming remains.

Cats have similar restrictions on f monsters, but f monsters are
considerably less common than d in the early game.



